-- חוזר לבעלויות תשס"ט/2 — עדכון פרטי בעלויות תשס"ט (2.12.2008)
-- Every owning body is asked to send, in a printed letter, the details of
-- the office-holder its circulars are to be addressed to, by post or fax.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `עדכון פרטי בעלויות תשס"ט`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 akn:hc_1/p2 akn:hc_1/p3 akn:hc_1/p4 akn:hc_1/p5 akn:hc_1/p6 akn:hc_1/p7 akn:hc_1/p8 The letterhead, title, date (2.12.2008) and addressee (the owning bodies of educational institutions); no rule.

@desc The details §§1–6 ask of each owning body.
DECLARE `owning body details` HAS
    `name of the office-holder`          IS A STRING  @desc first name and family name of the office-holder the circular is to be addressed to
    `title of the office`                IS A STRING  @desc e.g. human-resources manager, comptroller
    `name of the owning body`            IS A STRING
    `belongs to the Centre of Local Government` IS A BOOLEAN
    `telephone with area code`           IS A STRING
    `street and house number`            IS A STRING
    `city and postcode`                  IS A STRING

-- §§1–6: the details are complete when every one is given.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_1 akn:hc_1__para_2 akn:hc_1__para_3 akn:hc_1__para_4 akn:hc_1__para_5 akn:hc_1__para_6
GIVEN d IS AN `owning body details`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the details are complete` d IF
    all (GIVEN s YIELD NOT (s EQUALS ""))
        (LIST d's `name of the office-holder`, d's `title of the office`, d's `name of the owning body`,
              d's `telephone with area code`, d's `street and house number`, d's `city and postcode`)

DECLARE `how sent` IS ONE OF
    `by post`
    `by fax to 02-5604722`
    `by e-mail or another way`

DECLARE `details action` IS ONE OF
    `send the details in a printed letter` HAS `sent details` IS AN `owning body details`
                                               `sent by` IS A `how sent`

-- ¶9–10 and §6 ¶2–4: so the unit's circulars reach each owning body, every
-- owning body sends the details in a printed letter, by post or by fax, to
-- the conditions-of-service department, Kanfei Nesharim 15, Jerusalem. No
-- date is printed.
@ref akn:hc_1/p9 akn:hc_1/p10 akn:hc_1__para_6/p2 akn:hc_1__para_6/p3 akn:hc_1__para_6/p4
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `details action`
DECIDE `each owning body sends its details` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `send the details in a printed letter` d way
          PROVIDED `the details are complete` d
                   AND (way EQUALS `by post` OR way EQUALS `by fax to 02-5604722`)

-- §6 ¶5: the department's circulars are also published on its website, as
-- soon as they are sent, at the address printed at the foot of the page (the
-- corpus text does not carry the page foot).
@ref akn:hc_1__para_6/p5
`circulars are also published on the department's website` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and signature; no rule.

§§ `Examples`

`a complete reply` MEANS
    `owning body details` WITH
        `name of the office-holder`          IS "ישראל ישראלי"
        `title of the office`                IS "מנהל כ\"א"
        `name of the owning body`            IS "בעלות לדוגמה"
        `belongs to the Centre of Local Government` IS TRUE
        `telephone with area code`           IS "02-0000000"
        `street and house number`            IS "רחוב 1"
        `city and postcode`                  IS "ירושלים 00000"

#ASSERT `the details are complete` `a complete reply`

#TRACE `each owning body sends its details` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `send the details in a printed letter` `a complete reply` `by fax to 02-5604722` AT 5
